<section id="prices" class="px-5 md:px-30 py-9 md:py-16 bg-subtle text-ink"><div class="flex flex-col gap-5 md:gap-7"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2 md:gap-3.5"><p class="font-medium text-[10px] md:text-[11.5px] tracking-[0.15em] md:tracking-[0.16em] text-accent">NO SURPRISES</p><h2 class="font-display font-bold text-[25px] md:text-[42px] leading-[1.16] md:leading-[1.14] tracking-[-0.005em] max-w-[54rem]">What things actually cost.</h2><p class="max-w-[52rem] text-[15px] md:text-[17px] leading-[1.58] text-ink-soft">Real flat rates from our last 500 jobs. Your price is signed on your doorstep before we start, and it does not move.</p></div><div class="overflow-hidden rounded-[14px] border border-rule bg-surface"><table class="w-full border-collapse text-left"><thead><tr class="border-b border-rule bg-mist text-[10.5px] md:text-[11.5px] font-medium tracking-[0.14em] text-ink-soft"><th class="px-4 py-3 md:px-[30px] md:py-4 font-medium">JOB</th><th class="px-4 py-3 md:px-[30px] md:py-4 text-right font-medium md:w-[190px]">FLAT PRICE FROM</th><th class="hidden md:table-cell px-[30px] py-4 text-right font-medium w-[200px]">TYPICAL TIME ON SITE</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class="border-b border-rule"><td class="px-4 py-3 md:px-[30px] md:py-3.5 text-[14px] md:text-[16px] font-semibold text-ink">Blocked drain — machine cleared</td><td class="px-4 py-3 md:px-[30px] md:py-3.5 text-right font-display font-num text-[17px] md:text-[19px] font-bold text-accent">$149</td><td class="hidden md:table-cell px-[30px] py-3.5 text-right text-[15px] text-ink-soft">45–90 min</td></tr><tr class="border-b border-rule"><td class="px-4 py-3 md:px-[30px] md:py-3.5 text-[14px] md:text-[16px] font-semibold text-ink">Leaking tap, mixer or cistern</td><td class="px-4 py-3 md:px-[30px] md:py-3.5 text-right font-display font-num text-[17px] md:text-[19px] font-bold text-accent">$129</td><td class="hidden md:table-cell px-[30px] py-3.5 text-right text-[15px] text-ink-soft">30–60 min</td></tr><tr class="border-b border-rule"><td class="px-4 py-3 md:px-[30px] md:py-3.5 text-[14px] md:text-[16px] font-semibold text-ink">Toilet repair or full replacement</td><td class="px-4 py-3 md:px-[30px] md:py-3.5 text-right font-display font-num text-[17px] md:text-[19px] font-bold text-accent">$189</td><td class="hidden md:table-cell px-[30px] py-3.5 text-right text-[15px] text-ink-soft">1–2 hrs</td></tr><tr class="border-b border-rule"><td class="px-4 py-3 md:px-[30px] md:py-3.5 text-[14px] md:text-[16px] font-semibold text-ink">Hot water system — repair</td><td class="px-4 py-3 md:px-[30px] md:py-3.5 text-right font-display font-num text-[17px] md:text-[19px] font-bold text-accent">$215</td><td class="hidden md:table-cell px-[30px] py-3.5 text-right text-[15px] text-ink-soft">1–3 hrs</td></tr><tr class="border-b border-rule"><td class="px-4 py-3 md:px-[30px] md:py-3.5 text-[14px] md:text-[16px] font-semibold text-ink">Hot water system — full replacement</td><td class="px-4 py-3 md:px-[30px] md:py-3.5 text-right font-display font-num text-[17px] md:text-[19px] font-bold text-accent">$1,290</td><td class="hidden md:table-cell px-[30px] py-3.5 text-right text-[15px] text-ink-soft">half day</td></tr><tr class="border-b border-rule"><td class="px-4 py-3 md:px-[30px] md:py-3.5 text-[14px] md:text-[16px] font-semibold text-ink">Burst or leaking pipe repair</td><td class="px-4 py-3 md:px-[30px] md:py-3.5 text-right font-display font-num text-[17px] md:text-[19px] font-bold text-accent">$265</td><td class="hidden md:table-cell px-[30px] py-3.5 text-right text-[15px] text-ink-soft">1–3 hrs</td></tr><tr class="border-b border-rule"><td class="px-4 py-3 md:px-[30px] md:py-3.5 text-[14px] md:text-[16px] font-semibold text-ink">CCTV drain camera inspection</td><td class="px-4 py-3 md:px-[30px] md:py-3.5 text-right font-display font-num text-[17px] md:text-[19px] font-bold text-accent">$199</td><td class="hidden md:table-cell px-[30px] py-3.5 text-right text-[15px] text-ink-soft">45 min</td></tr><tr class="border-b border-rule"><td class="px-4 py-3 md:px-[30px] md:py-3.5 text-[14px] md:text-[16px] font-semibold text-ink">Sewer line clear and report</td><td class="px-4 py-3 md:px-[30px] md:py-3.5 text-right font-display font-num text-[17px] md:text-[19px] font-bold text-accent">$390</td><td class="hidden md:table-cell px-[30px] py-3.5 text-right text-[15px] text-ink-soft">2–4 hrs</td></tr><tr class="border-b border-rule"><td class="px-4 py-3 md:px-[30px] md:py-3.5 text-[14px] md:text-[16px] font-semibold text-ink">Full repipe — 3 bedroom house</td><td class="px-4 py-3 md:px-[30px] md:py-3.5 text-right font-display font-num text-[17px] md:text-[19px] font-bold text-accent">$4,800</td><td class="hidden md:table-cell px-[30px] py-3.5 text-right text-[15px] text-ink-soft">2–3 days</td></tr></tbody></table><div class="flex items-start gap-3 bg-mist px-4 py-4 md:px-[30px] md:pb-[22px] md:pt-5"><span class="font-semibold text-success">✓</span><p class="text-[13.5px] md:text-[14.5px] font-medium leading-[1.55] text-ink-mid"><span class="md:hidden">Call-out $89, credited in full against approved work. Nights and weekends add $60.</span><span class="hidden md:inline">Call-out is $89 and is credited in full against any work you approve. Nights, weekends and public holidays add $60. That is the entire price list — there is nothing else.</span></p></div></div></div></section>
